{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Through the use of theorems on logarithms \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab4061dea42b030ef27010ded82fa8914b929b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log{\\frac{a}{b}} + \\log{\\frac{b}{c}} + \\log{\\frac{c}{d}} - \\log{\\frac{ay}{dx}}\\]\" width=\"233\" height=\"37\" />\ncan be reduced to: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c92ba18ca7a9cac7225757de1e8535cc37046c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\log{\\frac{y}{x}}\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\log{\\frac{x}{y}}\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 140x-24x^2+x^3\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"332\" height=\"57\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the properties <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0afde91d61f8040e2b18b1959d9acf8ca65f1874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(x)+\\log(y)=\\log(xy)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/f/acf2a4d482c3e210cee70a77df6151289dc864df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(x)-\\log(y)=\\log(x/y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e1463e82e8da319c60ce87a898e982b4a099b179.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log\\frac ab+\\log\\frac bc+\\log\\frac cd-\\log\\frac{ay}{dx}&amp;=\\log\\left(\\frac ab\\cdot\\frac bc\\cdot\\frac cd\\right)-\\log \\frac {ay}{dx} \\\\ &amp;=\\log \\frac ad-\\log\\frac{ay}{dx} \\\\ &amp;=\\log\\left(\\frac{\\frac ad}{\\frac{ay}{dx}}\\right) \\\\ &amp;=\\log \\frac xy, \\end{align*}\" width=\"447\" height=\"176\" />\nso the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca510ed0ea23781fc90fe719b67edc35e823a34e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\log\\frac xy}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"87\" height=\"47\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.